title: "ertabat — a communication engineering domain on the dhancha spine"
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: "A FAKIR domain for communication engineering: one capability surface for a link whose geometry is changing, conformance conditions with UCUM units (two honestly unestablished), a closed four-point integration boundary, a priced bill of materials that refuses a total over the priced subset, and work packets with executable acceptance criteria."
